        "line": 535,
        "text": "theorem square_half_power (lam R : ℝ) (hR : 0 < R) : (R ^ 2 / 2) ^ (-(1 / 2 + lam)) = (2 : ℝ) ^ (1 / 2 + lam) * R ^ (-1 - 2 * lam)"
